    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2705<i> Coming soon to Steam! Play 23 authentic LCD-style minigames and relive the 90s!</i></strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Mini Games Retro 90s</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The most faithful digital tribute to 80s and 90s LCD handheld games.</strong><br><i>Mini Games Retro 90s</i> brings back the unmistakable look and feel of those classic LCD handhelds \u2014 the same ones you played for hours in the 80s and 90s, sometimes lovingly called <i>\u201cMinigames do Paraguai.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 23 built-in mini-games and more on the way, this is pure, authentic nostalgia \u2014 no pixels, no modern effects. Just that charming black-and-white LCD style you know and love.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae What's Included?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>23 classic-style LCD mini-games</strong>, each one recreated with care to mimic the original gameplay and visuals:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfce\ufe0fCar Racing \ud83c\udfce\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfbeTennis\ud83c\udfbe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd0Volleyball\ud83c\udfd0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfcd\ufe0fMotorcycle\ud83c\udfcd\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfcd\ufe0fMotorcycle II\ud83c\udfcd\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26bdSoccer\u26bd</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd2Ice Hockey\ud83c\udfd2</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc1Formula 1\ud83c\udfc1</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc08Cat and Mice\ud83d\udc01</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc38Frog\ud83d\udc38</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc0Basketball\u26f9\ufe0f\u200d\u2640\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd77Shogun \ud83e\udd77\ud83c\udffd</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc09Dragon\ud83d\udc09</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfce\ufe0fGrand Prix\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee5\ufe0fBoat Racing\ud83d\udee5\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2693Lift Boat\u2693</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc7bGhost Buster\ud83d\udc7b</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0aSubmarine\ud83c\udf0a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26bdSoccer 2\u26bd</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc11Sheep Dog\ud83d\udc36</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc0eWild Horse\ud83d\udc0e</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc7dU.F.O.\ud83d\udef8</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee3\ufe0fHighway\ud83d\ude95</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd32 <strong>Faithful LCD-style graphics</strong><br><i>Just like your old handhelds, including static backgrounds and pre-drawn frames.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Instant arcade fun</strong><br><i>Simple to learn, hard to master.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Controller Support</strong><br><i>Fully compatible with gamepads and controllers for a smooth experience.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Global Leaderboards</strong><br><i>Compete for the top score worldwide.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Achievements</strong><br><i>Unlock rewards as you play and progress.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0b <strong>Battery Simulation Mode</strong><br><i>Experience the charm (and suspense) of draining battery indicators.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Bonus Content:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfed Console Factory</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Customize and build your own minigames. Choose figures, colors, console models, and even the images of each sprite within the games and create unique and exclusive minigames!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844720/extras/9db2f1044bd43639cbf06135effb4fec.avif?t=1753990379\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844720/extras/7e0dc76a6dc1bd945290953ee35eb0d5.avif?t=1753990379\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd04 Ongoing Support &amp; Updates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the beginning. We're committed to adding <strong>more mini-games and features regularly</strong>, always staying true to the LCD handheld experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd2 Remember those beeps?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pixels. No shaders. Just raw, honest fun \u2014 the way it used to be.</p>",
